get=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc280D_m6qfaRxaWcLJctCVga-I1KQLA19rRjDAqjmZQx0uIA/viewform\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc280D_m6qfaRxaWcLJctCVga-I1KQLA19rRjDAqjmZQx0uIA/viewform\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc280D_m6qfaRxaWcLJctCVga-I1KQLA19rRjDAqjmZQx0uIA/viewform </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> In addition to going out via email, the link also appears directly under the download link when you complete your purchase on DriveThruRPG.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-08T11:42:56-07:00","id":1454536,"title":"","content":"Quite a nice product. I gave up my budget for steak this week for it... so truly, truly, a sacrifice. <br /> <br /> I like the fact<i> really</i> like the fact that the aliens come across as alien, without the lazy writing you see so often of &quot;they do incomprehensible, insane things, because they're alien.&quot; Even if the mindsets aren't human, there's an underlying logic that makes it possible to interact with them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1458-newk","name":"NewK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-08T14:43:09-07:00","id":1454549,"title":"","content":"Thanks Ian!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-08T14:55:38-07:00","id":1454550,"title":"","content":"So disappointed we didn't get info on building Doyen player characters. Kidding. <br /> <br /> Fantastic book, incorporating the latest in sci fi themes on aliens who are comprehensible but definitely alien in mind as well as body.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26448-shalmaneser","name":"Shalmaneser","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-08T18:43:03-07:00","id":1454564,"title":"","content":"I love this book and have been wanting to do something like it since I was writing for Trinity 1e back in the late 90s. So, who is your favorite playable alien species? I'm tied between the Qin and the Coalition. I love how utterly alien the Qin are, and both alien Talents are nifty and also, alien freedom fighters who are attempting to move beyond their genetically engineered &quot;purpose&quot; is very cool. So, what's your favorite?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/96-john-snead","name":"John Snead","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar96_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-08T21:55:14-07:00","id":1454569,"title":"","content":"One thing I enuoy is that the aliens are evocative, full of possible story threads... yet free of 'here is doom.&quot; You don't have to say: I can't use the HExers because that will blow up every other plot a'la the Yozi Restoration. It's entirely possible to have these groups involved, yet be able to say: there's lots of other stuff happening in the universe, so they won't dominate everything. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1458-newk","name":"NewK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-09T07:07:44-07:00","id":1454577,"title":"","content":"Yes. It is quite good. I have some questions (which I have sent in), but otherwise enjoy the book. Very excited to see the Adventure! version of this concept.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/2504943\" target=\"_blank\">The Big Over Easy</a></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","name":"MythAdvocate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-12T08:33:23-07:00","id":1454745,"title":"","content":"Are human Talents allowed to access any of the Coalition phyle Gifts? I can't find an actual statement anywhere that says you need to be Coalition to learn them (whereas p. 68 says explicitly that only phyle characters can learn the listed Edges, p. 69 says the same for the Paths, etc.).<br /> <br /> I mean, it does suggest that the phyle Gifts generally reflect how the character was genetically created, but I can't think of any reason why a human Talent shouldn't be able to have Reliable Comrade or Fast Friendship or Hotwire. Of course, a few really <i>don't</i> make sense for humans, like Towering Form or Durable as Stone. (And then there's Impervious Chitin, where the <i>name</i> certainly implies a human shouldn't have it, but the <i>effect</i> seems perfectly reasonable for a human Talent.)<br /> <br /> I dunno. Is anything going to go horribly wrong if you allow some of these on a case-by-case basis?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11237-jefepato","name":"Jefepato","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-12T08:44:08-07:00","id":1454747,"title":"","content":"It's probably fine. I'm sure there is probably some combination of gifts from the core book and different phyles of UAS which is totally broken, but that shouldn't be hard to clear up with a table conversation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-12T17:49:43-07:00","id":1454776,"title":"","content":"I was reasonably certain that Purpose Gifts did need you to be one of the Coalition phyles, even if you didn't need to be that phyle. Will double check and add it to the errata if not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-14T20:17:00-07:00","id":1454937,"title":"","content":"Idea: The Breach, and the Ascendant Hexers if you go for the &quot;HIs are programmed as genocide machines of rebels&quot;, are the same species, because the plane they ended up in happened to be neighbors with the Yarrans.<br /> <br /> The Yarrans were not pleased when they realized what their new neighbors did. Hence, the Flux raids, because it's the only weapon that can hurt noetic-based beings who are kicking their asses, as shown by the Doyen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-14T20:26:27-07:00","id":1454938,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1454527-\u00e6on-under-alien-skies?p=1454776#post1454776\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was reasonably certain that Purpose Gifts did need you to be one of the Coalition phyles, even if you didn't need to be that phyle. Will double check and add it to the errata if not.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that was the intent, yes. That's not to say that you can't raid the Purpose Gifts for ideas when devising Gifts for your human Talents; but technically they wouldn't be the <i>same</i> Gifts, even if they're nearly identical.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}